    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiSZwb5hCUh9boGExTOdxet6nJcg8UmU3RCF853kfT3nefwuwYD6ICP9d7-KqLzjrbBDdy7ivt6p-peOIgXASC3SqA_-VLcNKprRG-pB9qDnZOeZm8jew5nbCetTR3aBj99q-w8W5BTmeCd/s2048/%25E9%25A2%25A8%25E4%25B8%25AD%25E7%259A%2584%25E5%2590%258D%25E5%25AD%259711%2528180+cm+x+240cm%2529.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1503\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"470\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiSZwb5hCUh9boGExTOdxet6nJcg8UmU3RCF853kfT3nefwuwYD6ICP9d7-KqLzjrbBDdy7ivt6p-peOIgXASC3SqA_-VLcNKprRG-pB9qDnZOeZm8jew5nbCetTR3aBj99q-w8W5BTmeCd/w640-h470/%25E9%25A2%25A8%25E4%25B8%25AD%25E7%259A%2584%25E5%2590%258D%25E5%25AD%259711%2528180+cm+x+240cm%2529.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><p><br /></p><p><b>作品名稱</b></p><p>風中ê名字&nbsp;</p><p><br /></p><p><b>作品簡介</b></p><p>獻hōo</p><p>二二八</p><p>kap</p><p>白色恐怖政治受難前輩</p><p>以及</p><p>自án-ne來受苦ê</p><p>政治受難家屬</p><p><br /></p><p>大地無話</p><p>只有</p><p>風飛--過</p><p>名字飛--過</p><p><br /></p><p><b>創作方式</b></p><p>油畫</p><p><br /></p><p><b>作者簡介</b></p><p><br /></p><p>陳武鎮，1949年出世，屏東縣萬巒鄉佳佐村人。</p><p><br /></p><p>1969年tuì台南師專美勞組畢業，tī海軍做兵ê時，tsiânn做白色恐怖受難者，tī台東泰源監獄坐監兩冬。出獄了後補做兵，回復美勞教職，2004年tuì新營國小退休，全力投入人權畫作kap木雕ê創作。</p><p><br /></p><p>2007年出版《夢回泰源》油畫集，2008年出版《虛擬巨惡》油畫集，2010年出版《風中的名字》、《山》油畫集，2011年出版《判決書》油畫集，2012年出版《消失的家人》《爪與牙》《刑求》一套三冊油畫集，2014年設計製造「泰源事件紀念碑」，2017年出版《那一場雪》油畫、木雕作品集。伊用藝術創作來表現對人權ê關心、對公義ê追求kap對暴政ê抗訴。</p><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjOB1EzQ3nL-AoFK-sUqetETtwnowW9PHRs-obd3Kg33p6r4a3aJI-K5Asi42Pl1kxFybbwqpu9r9brENLfdFYiplG9tPPRHQiR78XjcgqXoZYH6MnEiiF8pxD7FH4ehQgeVlzMaDs2HeLS/s1424/321%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjOB1EzQ3nL-AoFK-sUqetETtwnowW9PHRs-obd3Kg33p6r4a3aJI-K5Asi42Pl1kxFybbwqpu9r9brENLfdFYiplG9tPPRHQiR78XjcgqXoZYH6MnEiiF8pxD7FH4ehQgeVlzMaDs2HeLS/s320/321%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><b style=\"font-size: small; text-align: left;\">台文通訊BONG報321期，2020年12月出刊。</b></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b><br /></b></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><b>歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　</b></span></div><div><b><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></b></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><b>線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2A